So if $n \equiv 0 \pmod 3$, Vanya cannot win on his first move.
He must move to a number not divisible by 3.
Then Vova moves.
Vova wants to prevent Vanya from winning.
Vanya wins if he can reach a multiple of 3.
Vova wins if he can keep the number non-divisible by 3 for 5 rounds.

